FuchsiaCity_House1_Text_WardenIsOldHasFalseTeeth::
    .string "The SAFARI ZONE's WARDEN is old, \n"
    .string "but he's still very much active.\p"
    .string "All his teeth are false, though.$"

FuchsiaCity_House1_Text_BillIsMyGrandson::
    .string "Hmm?\n"
    .string "You've met BILL?\p"
    .string "He's my grandson!\p"
    .string "He always liked collecting things,\n"
    .string "even as a child!$"

FuchsiaCity_House1_Text_BillFilesHisOwnMonData::
    .string "BILL files his own POKéMON data on\n"
    .string "his PC.\p"
    .string "Did he show you?$"

FuchsiaCity_House1_Text_AreYouTheChampion::
    .string "Oh!\n"
    .string "You wouldn't happen to be the\l"
    .string "new CHAMPION, would you?\p"
    .string "I've heard about you from BILL!\p"
    .string "You should check on something\n"
    .string "for me.\p"
    .string "Being the CHAMPION means you\n"
    .string "need to help people in need!\p"
    .string "Anyway, I've got some old\n"
    .string "friends that need to be taken\l"
    .string "care of.\p"
    .string "I'm too old for this kind of\n"
    .string "thing anymore.\p"
    .string "Here, I insist!$"

FuchsiaCity_House1_Text_TakeGoodCare::
    .string "Take good care of them.\p"
    .string "They're your problem now!$"
